{"node_id": "real_067_batch_62_NIH_MedlinePlus_MagazineWinter2022_16_HY_006", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0010"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0010_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "● Pain and swelling in cartilage\n(especially in ears and nose)\n● Pain, redness, and swelling in joints\n● Sore throat, neck pain, and hoarseness\n● Hearing loss, tinnitus (ringing), and dizziness", "semantic_text": "● Pain and swelling in cartilage (especially in ears and nose) ● Pain, redness, and swelling in joints ● Sore throat, neck pain, and hoarseness ● Hearing loss, tinnitus (ringing), and dizziness", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0010_geometry", "bbox": [125, 840, 531, 970], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0010"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_67/hybrid/real_067_batch_62_NIH_MedlinePlus_MagazineWinter2022/page_0016/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_067_batch_62_NIH_MedlinePlus_MagazineWinter2022_16_HY_007", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0011"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0011_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Most people don't know about RP, so Meredith has\nlearned to ask, “do you know what that is?” when she meets\nsomeone new.", "semantic_text": "Most people don't know about RP, so Meredith has learned to ask, “do you know what that is?” when she meets someone new.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0011_geometry", "bbox": [100, 996, 598, 1072], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0011"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_67/hybrid/real_067_batch_62_NIH_MedlinePlus_MagazineWinter2022/page_0016/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_067_batch_62_NIH_MedlinePlus_MagazineWinter2022_16_HY_008", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0013"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0013_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "RP is extremely rare, and like many rare diseases, RP is an\ninvisible disease. Doctors don't know what causes RP, and\ngetting the right diagnosis and treatment is one of the biggest\nchallenges for people who have it.", "semantic_text": "RP is extremely rare, and like many rare diseases, RP is an invisible disease. Doctors don't know what causes RP, and getting the right diagnosis and treatment is one of the biggest challenges for people who have it.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0013_geometry", "bbox": [101, 1127, 607, 1230], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0013"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_67/hybrid/real_067_batch_62_NIH_MedlinePlus_MagazineWinter2022/page_0016/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_067_batch_62_NIH_MedlinePlus_MagazineWinter2022_16_HY_009", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0014"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0014_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Without a biomarker (biological material that can\nmeasure and identify diseases), there's no way to test for RP.\nThis means that doctors need to rely on patients' symptoms\nto diagnose it. Unfortunately, RP can cause different kinds of\nsymptoms in different people. Symptoms also don't always\nseem related to each other, and they can come and go. For\nexample, Meredith said her ear isn't inflamed right now, but\nthat doesn't mean it won't be in the next few hours or days.", "semantic_text": "Without a biomarker (biological material that can measure and identify diseases), there's no way to test for RP. This means that doctors need to rely on patients' symptoms to diagnose it. Unfortunately, RP can cause different kinds of symptoms in different people. Symptoms also don't always seem related to each other, and they can come and go. For example, Meredith said her ear isn't inflamed right now, but that doesn't mean it won't be in the next few hours or days.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0014_geometry", "bbox": [101, 1231, 606, 1437], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0014"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_67/hybrid/real_067_batch_62_NIH_MedlinePlus_MagazineWinter2022/page_0016/decisions.json"}
